{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/extras/2526cf30603912eccc86ec850dec0662.avif?t=1761530528\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/extras_big/2526cf30603912eccc86ec850dec0662.webp?t=1761530528 width=1560 height=1170 /></span><strong>A thought-provoking and immersive story about a teenager who spends one night lost inside a mysterious game \u2014 capturing the beauty of nature through his camera, unaware that each photo brings him closer to the truth behind humanity\u2019s collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture the world\u2019s beauty.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From quiet rivers and deep forests to distant mountains glowing beneath the night sky \u2014 every photo you take reveals another piece of this living world and hints at the truth it hides.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/extras/627b347bd0f1185101539057627f9330.avif?t=1761530528\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relive your journey.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Revisit the photos in your album \u2014 the calm forests, falling light, and fragile details you might\u2019ve missed. Each image becomes a memory\u2026 and a reminder of how easily beauty can fade.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115790/extras/dec04423d911d438c379a190fb8a2592.avif?t=1761530528\" width=822 height=976 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Witness the cost of carelessness.</strong></h2><ul clas